{"seq":3,"slug":"profiling","title":"性能分析与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/engineering/profiling","wordCount":1112,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能分析与优化\">性能分析与优化</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Python 以开发效率著称，但在性能敏感场景中可能成为瓶颈。性能优化的核心原则是&quot;先测量，后优化&quot;——使用 profiler 找到真正的瓶颈，然后针对性地应用优化策略。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>优化不是猜谜，而是一条&quot;测量 → 定位 → 施治&quot;的闭环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;先测量&lt;br/&gt;禁止凭直觉优化&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;cProfile&lt;br/&gt;函数级定位 cumtime 最高的函数&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;line_profiler&lt;br/&gt;热点函数逐行分析&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D{瓶颈类型}&#10;  D -- 算法复杂度 --&gt; E[&quot;降阶:O(n²) → O(n log n)&quot;]&#10;  D -- 数据结构 --&gt; F[&quot;list → set/dict/deque 换 O(1) 查找&quot;]&#10;  D -- 计算密集 --&gt; G[&quot;NumPy / Numba / Cython / Rust 加速&quot;]&#10;  D -- 并行度 --&gt; H[&quot;进程池绕 GIL / 线程池跑 I/O&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; I[重新测量验证]&#10;  F --&gt; I&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[\"先测量&lt;br/&gt;禁止凭直觉优化\"] --&gt; B[\"cProfile&lt;br/&gt;函数级定位 cumtime 最高的函数\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"line_profiler&lt;br/&gt;热点函数逐行分析\"]\n  C --&gt; D{瓶颈类型}\n  D -- 算法复杂度 --&gt; E[\"降阶:O(n²) → O(n log n)\"]\n  D -- 数据结构 --&gt; F[\"list → set/dict/deque 换 O(1) 查找\"]\n  D -- 计算密集 --&gt; G[\"NumPy / Numba / Cython / Rust 加速\"]\n  D -- 并行度 --&gt; H[\"进程池绕 GIL / 线程池跑 I/O\"]\n  E --&gt; I[重新测量验证]\n  F --&gt; I\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>两条必须内化的原则：<strong>其一，先看算法再看底层</strong>——把 O(n²) 改成 O(n log n) 的收益往往远超任何微优化，过早陷入 <code>lru_cache</code>、<code>__slots__</code> 之类的细节是本末倒置；<strong>其二，测量工具要匹配场景</strong>——开发期用 cProfile + line_profiler，生产环境用零开销采样的 py-spy attach 到运行中的进程。内存问题则另需 memory_profiler，并用 <code>func.cache_info()</code> 监控缓存命中率。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能分析工具\">性能分析工具</h2><h3 id=\"cprofile\">cProfile</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"python -m cProfile -s cumulative my_script.py\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">python</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cProfile</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cumulative</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my_script.py</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import cProfile&#10;import pstats&#10;&#10;with cProfile.Profile() as pr:&#10;    result = expensive_function()&#10;&#10;stats = pstats.Stats(pr)&#10;stats.sort_stats(&quot;cumulative&quot;)&#10;stats.print_stats(20)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cProfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pstats</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cProfile.Profile() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pr:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expensive_function()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pstats.Stats(pr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stats.sort_stats(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cumulative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stats.print_stats(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>cProfile 的输出包含每个函数的调用次数（ncalls）、总耗时（tottime）和累计耗时（cumtime）。tottime 是函数自身代码的执行时间，cumtime 包括其调用的所有子函数时间。定位瓶颈时应关注 cumtime 最高的函数，然后用 line_profiler 进一步分析其内部热点行。</p>\n<h3 id=\"line_profiler\">line_profiler</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pip install line_profiler&#10;kernprof -l -v my_script.py\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> line_profiler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kernprof</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my_script.py</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@profile&#10;def compute():&#10;    a = [i ** 2 for i in range(1000000)]&#10;    b = sum(a)&#10;    return b\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@profile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"工具对比\">工具对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>cProfile</code></td>\n<td>函数级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>全局瓶颈定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>line_profiler</code></td>\n<td>行级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>热点函数逐行分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>memory_profiler</code></td>\n<td>行级内存</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>内存泄漏排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>py-spy</code></td>\n<td>采样式</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>生产环境 profiling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scalene</code></td>\n<td>CPU+内存+GPU</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>全面性能分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>py-spy 是生产环境 profiling 的首选工具——它通过系统调用读取目标进程的调用栈，无需修改代码或重启服务。可以直接 attach 到正在运行的 Python 进程，生成火焰图进行可视化分析。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"内存分析\">内存分析</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pip install memory_profiler&#10;python -m memory_profiler my_script.py\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> memory_profiler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">python</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> memory_profiler</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my_script.py</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from memory_profiler import profile&#10;&#10;@profile&#10;def load_data():&#10;    data = [i for i in range(10_000_000)]&#10;    filtered = [x for x in data if x % 2 == 0]&#10;    return filtered\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> memory_profiler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@profile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> load_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    filtered </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filtered</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常见内存问题\">常见内存问题</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大列表</td>\n<td>内存持续增长</td>\n<td>改用生成器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环引用</td>\n<td>对象无法被 GC</td>\n<td>使用 <code>weakref</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串拼接</td>\n<td>大量临时对象</td>\n<td>使用 <code>&quot;&quot;.join()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局缓存无限增长</td>\n<td>内存随时间膨胀</td>\n<td>使用 <code>functools.lru_cache</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>lru_cache</code> 默认的 <code>maxsize=128</code> 会在缓存满后自动淘汰最久未使用的条目。如果缓存的键空间较大（如对大范围参数缓存计算结果），应设置合理的 maxsize 防止内存无限增长。可以通过 <code>func.cache_info()</code> 查看缓存命中率来评估 maxsize 设置是否合理。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"python-级优化\">Python 级优化</h2><h3 id=\"数据结构选择\">数据结构选择</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>list</th>\n<th>set</th>\n<th>dict</th>\n<th>deque</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>查找</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插入（尾部）</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插入（头部）</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"常见优化技巧\">常见优化技巧</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"squares = [x ** 2 for x in range(1000)]&#10;&#10;squares_gen = (x ** 2 for x in range(1000))&#10;&#10;from functools import lru_cache&#10;&#10;@lru_cache(maxsize=256)&#10;def fib(n: int) -&gt; int:&#10;    if n &lt; 2:&#10;        return n&#10;    return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2)&#10;&#10;lookup = {item[&quot;id&quot;]: item for item in items}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">squares </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">squares_gen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> functools </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lru_cache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@lru_cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxsize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fib</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fib(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fib(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lookup </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {item[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]: item </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>列表推导式比等价的 for 循环快约 30%，因为它在 CPython 内部使用专用的 LIST_APPEND 字节码，省去了属性查找和函数调用的开销。生成器表达式则在内存方面有优势——它不创建完整列表，而是按需计算每个元素，适合处理大数据流。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"并行与并发加速\">并行与并发加速</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from concurrent.futures import ProcessPoolExecutor, ThreadPoolExecutor&#10;&#10;def cpu_bound(n: int) -&gt; int:&#10;    return sum(i * i for i in range(n))&#10;&#10;with ProcessPoolExecutor(max_workers=4) as executor:&#10;    results = list(executor.map(cpu_bound, [10**7] * 4))&#10;&#10;def io_bound(url: str) -&gt; str:&#10;    import urllib.request&#10;    return urllib.request.urlopen(url).read().decode()&#10;&#10;with ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=10) as executor:&#10;    results = list(executor.map(io_bound, urls))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> concurrent.futures </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ProcessPoolExecutor, ThreadPoolExecutor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cpu_bound</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;-